    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nAN EXCEPTIONAL COUNTRY RESIDENCE SET IN 1.75 ACRES OF PRIVATE GROUNDS\n\nA substantial detached residence surrounded by mature gardens and paddocks, offering an enviable combination of privacy, space and country living in the heart of County Wexford.\n\nSet discreetly within approximately 1.75 acres, Monroe is approached via an impressive private driveway and enjoys an exceptionally secluded setting. Mature evergreen screening, established trees and beautifully maintained lawns create a wonderful sense of privacy from the moment you arrive. The paddocks give the ability to keep a pony or two.\n\nBuilt in 1993 the property spans 231sq.mtrs. and flows exceptionally well. While in need of some modernisation, it is presented in good order throughout. The large central hall opens onto all of the ground floor rooms making it a great family home. \n\nOutside you have a tarmacadamed turning area with ample parking. The detached double garage could easily be used as a home office or may be suitable for conversion to a self contained unit. \n\nLocated just 12 kms from Wexford Town and five minutes drive from the Villages of Screen, Ballymurn and The Ballagh. Curracloe, Ballinesker and numerous other beaches are within a ten minute drive. \n\nA WONDERFUL DETACHED HOME IN A POPULAR LOCATION"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.7 x 5.38\nTimber Floor. Doors to:\n\nFamily Room - 4.93 x 4.56\nCarpet to floor, feature fireplace, bay window.\n\nOffice - 3.34 x 3.3\nCarpet to floor.\n\nLiving Room - 4.65 x 4.55\nFireplace, timber floor, door to sunroom.\n\nSun Room - 4.2 x 3.48\nTiled floor, door to rear patio.\n\nDining Room - 3.46 x 3.25\nTimber floor.\n\nKitchen - 5.45 x 3.74\nFitted kitchen with breakfast bar.\n\nUtility Room - 2.1 x 2.08\nSink unit, plumbed for w.m.\n\nToilet - 2.52 x 1.08\nGuest w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 5.15 x 4.83\nCarpet to floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.97 x 3.34\nTimber floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.87 x 3.83\nCarpet to floor.\n\nBathroom - 2.72 x 2.39\nTiled with bath, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nWalk in Hotpress - 2.72 x 1.85\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.9 x 3.63\nCarpet to floor, door to ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.36 x 0.85\nTiled with shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 4 - 6.7 x 4.81\nTimber floor, walk in wardrobe, door to ensuite\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.09 x 1.55\nTiled with shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nOutside - \nLarge 1.75 acre site with two paddocks,Double garage,Boiler House,Septic tank,OFCH.\n\n"
